damaged_code:
```c
// CPU 0
WRITE_ONCE(x, 1);
smp_store_release(&y, 1);

// CPU 1
r1 = smp_load_acquire(&y);
WRITE_ONCE(z, 1); // Plain write! Breaks chain

// CPU 2
r2 = smp_load_acquire(&z);
r3 = READ_ONCE(x); // Can return 0!
```

fix:
Chain CPU 1's intermediate step using release-acquire.
```c
// CPU 1
r1 = smp_load_acquire(&y);
smp_store_release(&z, 1); // Restores chain
```
